    "text": "Her com \u00c6lfred, se unsce\u00f0\u00f0iga \u00e6\u00feeling, \u00c6\u00feelr\u00e6des sunu cinges, hider inn and wolde to his meder, \u00fee\nAc hit him ne ge\u00feafode Godwine eorl, ne ec o\u00fere men \u00fee mycel mihton wealdan, for\u00f0an hit hleo\u00f0rode \u00fea\nAc Godwine hine \u00fea gelette and hine on h\u00e6ft sette, and his geferan he todraf, and sume mislice ofsloh.\nSume hi man wi\u00f0 feo sealde, sume hreowlice acwealde, sume hi man bende, sume hi man blende, sume\nNe wear\u00f0 dreorlicre d\u00e6d gedon on \u00feison earde, sy\u00fe\u00fean Dene comon and her fri\u00f0 namon.\nNu is to gelyfenne to \u00f0an leofan gode, \u00fe\u00e6t hi blission bli\u00f0e mid Criste \u00fee w\u00e6ron butan scylde swa\nSe \u00e6\u00feeling lyfode \u00fea gyt; \u00e6lc yfel man him gehet, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t man ger\u00e6dde \u00fe\u00e6t man hine l\u00e6dde to\nSona swa he lende, on scype man hine blende, and hine swa blindne brohte to \u00f0am munecon, and he \u00fear\nSy\u00f0\u00f0an hine man byrigde, swa him wel gebyrede, ful wur\u00f0lice, swa he wyr\u00f0e w\u00e6s, \u00e6t \u00feam westende,",
